## Agent Skills Integration
- **Context Reference:** Always leverage the knowledge bases located in `.agents/skills/`.
- Prioritize design patterns defined in `web-design-guidelines`.
- Adhere strictly to the practices outlined in `vercel-react-best-practices`.
- Use syntax rules and utilities documented in `tailwind-4-docs`.

## Tech Stack & Architecture
- Use **Next.js 14+ App Router** conventions (Server Components by default).
- Implement strictly typed **TypeScript** interfaces and props; avoid `any`.
- Utilize **Tailwind CSS** for all component styling, leveraging modern utility classes.

## Code Standards
- **Components:** Functional components with descriptive, named exports.
- **Data Fetching:** Fetch data in Server Components where possible; use `async/await`.
- **State Management:** Use standard React hooks (`useState`, `useActionState`) only in Client Components (`'use client'`).

## UI & Design Rules
- Follow mobile-first responsive design (`sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`).
- Maintain consistent spacing using Tailwind's spacing scale (e.g., `p-4`, `space-y-6`).
- Ensure accessible, semantic HTML tags (`<main>`, `<section>`, `<article>`).
